    "summary": "migrateChatSessionsFromMemento, in session-file-store.ts, moves each indexed session from the memento into the store's files: it writes rows then head when no head exists, appends the missing rows when the files hold a prefix, writes nothing when the files hold more, then reads the files back and compares them with the memento's copy before it removes the memento key. A session that fails, disagrees or is not a session is left untouched, logged and returned in kept; the index is rewritten to the kept ids or removed. A memento write that fails later is logged rather than left as an unhandled rejection. Nothing calls the migration yet; that is task 5.",
